                            <p>Tuljārājirājē Bhōsle. Ś. 1697-1775 A.D.</p>						
                            
                            <p>This record in Marāṭhī, written in Nāgarī, is dated in Śaka 1697, Manmatha, Vaiśākha 1 and states that the <hi rend="italic">prākara</hi> was built by Rājēśrī Tuljā-rājirājē Bhōslē Sāhēb. </p>						
                            
